{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"interface-toggleselectedoptions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Interface: ToggleSelectedOptions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.types.ts#L11","children":[{"type":"text","value":"features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.types.ts:11"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Controls how toggling a row affects its descendants and ancestors."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"deselectparents","children":[{"type":"text","value":"deselectParents?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional deselectParents: boolean;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.types.ts#L27","children":[{"type":"text","value":"features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.types.ts:27"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Whether ancestor row ids should be removed from the selection when this\nrow is deselected. Useful after a parent cascade wrote the parent id into\nstate and a child is later deselected. Defaults to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ancestor ids are removed even when the ancestor itself cannot be selected.\nLike the other targeted deselection paths, pruning is not gated by\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"enableRowSelection"},{"type":"text","value":"; only the bulk select-all paths preserve\nnon-selectable rows."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"selectchildren","children":[{"type":"text","value":"selectChildren?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional selectChildren: boolean;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.types.ts#L16","children":[{"type":"text","value":"features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.types.ts:16"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Whether selectable child rows should be toggled recursively. Defaults to\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"interface-toggleselectedoptions","text":"Interface: ToggleSelectedOptions","level":1},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"deselectparents","text":"deselectParents?","level":3},{"id":"selectchildren","text":"selectChildren?","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Interface: ToggleSelectedOptions\n\nDefined in: [features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.types.ts:11](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.types.ts#L11)\n\nControls how toggling a row affects its descendants and ancestors.\n\n## Properties\n\n### deselectParents?\n\n```ts\noptional deselectParents: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.types.ts:27](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.types.ts#L27)\n\nWhether ancestor row ids should be removed from the selection when this\nrow is deselected. Useful after a parent cascade wrote the parent id into\nstate and a child is later deselected. Defaults to `false`.\n\nAncestor ids are removed even when the ancestor itself cannot be selected.\nLike the other targeted deselection paths, pruning is not gated by\n`enableRowSelection`; only the bulk select-all paths preserve\nnon-selectable rows.\n\n***\n\n### selectChildren?\n\n```ts\noptional selectChildren: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.types.ts:16](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.types.ts#L16)\n\nWhether selectable child rows should be toggled recursively. Defaults to\n`true`.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ToggleSelectedOptions\ntitle: ToggleSelectedOptions\n---\n\n# Interface: ToggleSelectedOptions\n\nDefined in: [features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.types.ts:11](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.types.ts#L11)\n\nControls how toggling a row affects its descendants and ancestors.\n\n## Properties\n\n### deselectParents?\n\n```ts\noptional deselectParents: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.types.ts:27](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.types.ts#L27)\n\nWhether ancestor row ids should be removed from the selection when this\nrow is deselected. Useful after a parent cascade wrote the parent id into\nstate and a child is later deselected. Defaults to `false`.\n\nAncestor ids are removed even when the ancestor itself cannot be selected.\nLike the other targeted deselection paths, pruning is not gated by\n`enableRowSelection`; only the bulk select-all paths preserve\nnon-selectable rows.\n\n***\n\n### selectChildren?\n\n```ts\noptional selectChildren: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.types.ts:16](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-selection/rowSelectionFeature.types.ts#L16)\n\nWhether selectable child rows should be toggled recursively. Defaults to\n`true`.\n"}
